{
  "title": "Hearty Charred Kenyan Meat Kebabs",
  "description": "A crowd-pleasing Kenyan dish featuring charred meat and a hint of Appleton rum, served with a side of lamination-puff, this recipe is a low-calorie-friendly option for any meal.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
